 is the largest single buyer of grid equipment in Caldria (source: utility-capex-2027).\n- **Data centres:** Grid connection requests are expected to grow 9% in 2027. That is slower than in 2026, because power availability limits new sites (source: datacentre-demand). Demand is still growing, but the pace is slowing.\n- **Relevance to VLTX:** Utilities account for 62% of VLTX holdings' orders. Pellham is 35% of those utility orders and Norvane is 21%. Together they make up 56% of utility orders, so VLTX is exposed to these two customers and to Pellham most of all (source: vltx-order-mix).\n- **Caveat:** These are planned budgets, not confirmed orders. Whether the utilities can finance the plans is a separate question that node n3 is covering. Utility bond spreads widened 30bp in Q3 2026 to 165bp, and equity markets have been less receptive to utilities.","ttft_ms":2603,"type":"result","duration_ms":17203,"uuid":"4911f506-0ebb-4867-b60b-325208830666","ttft_stream_ms":1171,"time_to_request_ms":168,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":15,"system_prompt":10,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":16,"input_hooks":10,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":25,"tool_pool_refresh":9,"init_message":11,"init_frame_send":4,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":6,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":4,"request_announcements":22,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":7,"message_normalization":5,"client_creation":9,"request_build":8},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":116,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":80,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":203,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":129,"process_rss_mib_result":198,"process_anon_mib_result":117,"process_peak_rss_mib":203,"process_cpu_ms_turn":572,"process_wall_ms_turn":17200,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":55,"process_wall_ms_streaming":1814,"main_stream_count":3,"main_stream_event_count":132,"main_stream_chunk_count":15,"proce